			"notes": "- Added Moonrise, Async and C2ME support.\n- Improved interoperability with LeashedTeleport: ridden mounts and separately leashed animals can follow the same ender pearl or chorus fruit teleport.\n- Fixed rapid back-and-forth teleports leaving mounts behind or triggering premature timeouts.\n- Added bounded retries when destination terrain is still loading.\n- Fixed pending transfers and delayed remount recovery missing loaded but temporarily hidden mounts.\n- Fixed successful vanilla chorus teleports leaving stale transfers active, potentially returning the player to an earlier destination.\n- Improved nearby landing searches using actual collision shapes and fractional block surfaces.\n- Fixed false “not enough space” reports involving non-colliding vegetation, slabs and waterlogged support."
		},
