			"notes": "- Improved safe landing searches for mounted teleports, including fractional pearl impacts and slab surfaces.\n- Fixed chorus fruit landing checks and respected forbidden landing block tags.\n- Fixed teleport permission bypasses, relative teleport handling, and delayed remount issues.\n- Improved OPAC claim protection checks for pearls, chorus fruit, and general teleports.\n- Fixed retained player/world references and improved cleanup."
